WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.201
Your coding agent thinks in full sentences, and shows you almost none of them.

2
00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:07.712
Reezyn reads that thinking out loud.

3
00:00:08.512 --> 00:00:10.830
Agents fire tool calls in bursts.

4
00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.722
It waits for the pause, and keeps one thought.

5
00:00:14.522 --> 00:00:18.112
Adapter, coalescer, cleaner, then Kokoro, on your Mac.

6
00:00:18.912 --> 00:00:24.413
Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, Cursor, OpenCode, Freebuff: watched directly.

7
00:00:25.213 --> 00:00:28.098
Pause, skip, and a recap, in the menu bar.

8
00:00:28.398 --> 00:00:31.358
The CC viewer floats the line over your editor.

9
00:00:32.158 --> 00:00:36.371
Say Reezyn, and dictate; it types the draft and never sends it.

10
00:00:36.671 --> 00:00:40.264
When the turn ends it speaks the answer, and the mic reopens.

11
00:00:41.064 --> 00:00:43.942
Away from the desk, the session is on your phone.

12
00:00:44.242 --> 00:00:46.419
Over Tailscale, and nowhere else.

13
00:00:47.219 --> 00:00:50.209
No cloud, no telemetry, no summary model.

14
00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:52.848
Updates are verified before they land.

15
00:00:53.648 --> 00:00:57.932
Free, open source, a minute to install. Then it just talks.
